[{:db/id "q-316436/field-1/8a008595dbd9de87f0f7b53d7ce22b40a994912291fe2a6ce241519d4271f52e" :answer/id #uuid "1dcc6997-18c5-522e-881b-7cd4e1484779" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316436/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a4e0f91-106a-569f-8ca1-3f154f056429" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316436/field-1/8a008595dbd9de87f0f7b53d7ce22b40a994912291fe2a6ce241519d4271f52e" :answer-field/choices ["q-316436/field-1/8a008595dbd9de87f0f7b53d7ce22b40a994912291fe2a6ce241519d4271f52e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316436" :question/id #uuid "a092a38f-400b-570a-acab-c1982ddee78b" :question/math-academy-id "q-316436" :question/problem "Suppose that $|\\,m\\,|=12$, $|\\,n\\,|=9$ and that the angle between the vectors is $\\theta ={30}^{∘}.$ Find the vector projection of $m$ onto $n$ in terms of the vector $n.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{n}\\,m=$\n{{field-1}}\n$n$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,m & =|\\,m\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =12\\operatorname{cos}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =12\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $n:$\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{n}{|\\,n\\,|}=\\frac{n}{9}=\\frac{1}{9}n\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{n}\\,m & ={\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,m\\cdot u \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{9}n \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}n\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316436/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c9317eb-d1ce-5f42-b69b-a37e643b865b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316436"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275226/field-1/b011298f904080ddadc8f3a9691895d08ee34f3da37ff46aeef7f7e481c32a4d" :answer/id #uuid "862e3e33-0879-58d4-9652-f7d80110716e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275226/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "13e10029-59bf-5a97-b9e9-494663c4d23e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275226/field-1/b011298f904080ddadc8f3a9691895d08ee34f3da37ff46aeef7f7e481c32a4d" :answer-field/choices ["q-275226/field-1/b011298f904080ddadc8f3a9691895d08ee34f3da37ff46aeef7f7e481c32a4d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275226" :question/id #uuid "daea58c3-d874-52b1-9fd3-270fce74234d" :question/math-academy-id "q-275226" :question/problem "Suppose that $|\\,c\\,|=8$, $|\\,d\\,|=5$ and that the angle between the vectors is $\\theta ={45}^{∘}.$ Find the vector projection of $c$ onto $d$ in terms of the vector $d.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c=$\n{{field-1}}\n$d$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{d}\\,c & =|\\,c\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{cos}⁡({45}^{∘}) \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $d:$\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{d}{|\\,d\\,|}=\\frac{d}{5}=\\frac{1}{5}d\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c & ={\\text{comp}}_{d}\\,c\\cdot u \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}d \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{5}\\,d\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275226/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c9317eb-d1ce-5f42-b69b-a37e643b865b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275226"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection/d5850c51f2a04096dab8aeb604e3619cc72865300adf897e5952f4225e513b3c" :answer/id #uuid "fd2b00b5-25d4-5da2-9b6d-d9841eb827d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection/3fd54986de407038ce7078cbaadde2f61d9cd241cd3ea1dabeb4cb890d79bce4" :answer/id #uuid "a40df457-c932-5555-aff1-534cb35483cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection/6267cebed882a2d00e6654f5315ba60f860b7817d7e2157b3c58db054b2138fc" :answer/id #uuid "ff9db31d-0a43-57c5-8e40-0f5a4e8ca713" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection/cba4e39ce5cac37bcc7062b691f91e90e3564b9601907abbf6d00120ca172eac" :answer/id #uuid "226553df-249e-5602-b374-cd5a145abff8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection/99effbe3b54b67baaeb34a2eb94e44b1dcbaf2c3b1f7559b7514b772090e3081" :answer/id #uuid "3817e669-6cf2-5e7b-9eb0-b8235840dbc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "485c6674-fab3-5f38-a6f9-36bf4a4f7ad4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-18375/selection/3fd54986de407038ce7078cbaadde2f61d9cd241cd3ea1dabeb4cb890d79bce4" :answer-field/choices ["q-18375/selection/d5850c51f2a04096dab8aeb604e3619cc72865300adf897e5952f4225e513b3c" "q-18375/selection/3fd54986de407038ce7078cbaadde2f61d9cd241cd3ea1dabeb4cb890d79bce4" "q-18375/selection/6267cebed882a2d00e6654f5315ba60f860b7817d7e2157b3c58db054b2138fc" "q-18375/selection/cba4e39ce5cac37bcc7062b691f91e90e3564b9601907abbf6d00120ca172eac" "q-18375/selection/99effbe3b54b67baaeb34a2eb94e44b1dcbaf2c3b1f7559b7514b772090e3081"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-18375" :question/id #uuid "c0285a1e-a5cf-5cc8-a08b-5240464d9ec8" :question/math-academy-id "q-18375" :question/problem "Suppose that $|\\,a\\,|=6$, $|\\,b\\,|=2$ and that the angle between the vectors is $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{3}.$ Find the vector projection of $a$ onto $b$ in terms of the vector $b.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $b:$\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{b}{|\\,b\\,|}=\\frac{b}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}b\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & ={\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a\\cdot u \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}b \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}b\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-18375/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c9317eb-d1ce-5f42-b69b-a37e643b865b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-18375"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71839/selection/79731475345d0ad5041f51f5232eb51127c8017ff3a28b34e2a7d47327e30c8c" :answer/id #uuid "e890ca52-bb85-57e8-aeae-c7df14541488" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2p" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71839/selection/9524b46c8a7b7ce3889c9e663de70cf3912d6f7e21f723927f1fde6f412eaee6" :answer/id #uuid "5157be96-2b36-5c33-9ffa-ac7acc3a23fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}p" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71839/selection/2e2f90fc1179df2b9c286c6ca6bfa259786f82b9ff7fb856f86ca86dcac25c45" :answer/id #uuid "1eaf1eed-0496-58dc-9c75-cff822674ba5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4p" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71839/selection/8857829eb4b1dbb7ed2cc17c9f829217626735198166d575f95f5861c36a8a03" :answer/id #uuid "004b0b9a-dde8-55c8-bca0-cc1dfaf19285" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}p" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71839/selection/9bb7c75488ec423f5eb417827c6b6